OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786970910
OL,3,CVirgin Trains given major green light
OL,4,Cto rival Eurostar from 2030
OL,6,FVirgin Trains is set to launch
OL,7,Finternational services to Paris,
OL,8,FBrussels and Amsterdam, after being
OL,9,Fgranted pre-approval to access tracks
OL,10,Fup to the Channel Tunnel.
OL,12,FThe rail regulator, the Office of Rail
OL,13,Fand Road (ORR), said it had approved
OL,14,FSir Richard Branson's company to run
OL,15,Fup to 20 new daily return services
OL,16,Facross the Channel from October 1 2030
OL,17,Fto December 31 2040.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/5
