PN,30202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786970910
OL,3,CVirgin Trains given major green light
OL,4,Cto rival Eurostar from 2030
OL,6,FThis means Virgin Trains has passed
OL,7,Fanother key regulatory hurdle towards
OL,8,Fstarting the international services,
OL,9,Fafter being granted access last
OL,10,FOctober to share Eurostar's Temple
OL,11,FMills depot in east London to maintain
OL,12,Fand store trains.
OL,14,FEurostar, which is controlled by
OL,15,FFrench operator SNCF, has held a
OL,16,Fmonopoly on passenger services through
OL,17,Fthe tunnel since it opened in 1994.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/5
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
