PN,30203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786970910
OL,3,CVirgin Trains given major green light
OL,4,Cto rival Eurostar from 2030
OL,6,FSir Richard previously said it was
OL,7,F"time to end this 30-year monopoly and
OL,8,Fbring some Virgin magic to the cross-
OL,9,FChannel route".
OL,11,FThe announcement comes amid public
OL,12,Fcriticism regarding Eurostar prices.
OL,14,FThe ORR said the decision to grant
OL,15,Ftrack access was "an important next
OL,16,Fstep", but that there was "still more
OL,17,Fwork to do" before the new services
OL,18,Fcan run.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/5
