OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786970910
OL,3,CVirgin Trains given major green light
OL,4,Cto rival Eurostar from 2030
OL,6,FDeputy Director of Access and
OL,7,FInternational Martin Jones said: "This
OL,8,Fis an important next step in bringing
OL,9,Fcompetition and growth to the market
OL,10,Ffor international rail services, and
OL,11,Fwe welcome the progress Virgin Trains
OL,12,Fand London St Pancras High Speed have
OL,13,Fmade.
OL,15,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,16,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,17,Fcoverage from ITV Wales, sent direct
OL,18,Fto your inbox every Saturday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/5
