OL,3,CVirgin Trains given major green light
OL,4,Cto rival Eurostar from 2030
OL,6,F"While there is still more work to do,
OL,7,Fwe are supporting Virgin and the wider
OL,8,Findustry to grow international
OL,9,Fservices."
